[00:00.00] 作词 : David Gilmour/Polly Samson
[00:00.00][by:LadieuDuSilence]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : David Gilmour/Richard Wright
[01:11.27]
[01:13.67]For millions of years, mankind lived just like the animals
[01:13.67]数百万年以来，人类像动物一样活着
[01:23.29]Then something happened which unleashed the power of our imagination
[01:23.29]后来我们的想象力得到释放
[01:28.47]We learned to talk
[01:28.47]我们学会了说话
[01:30.05]
[01:30.99]There's a silence surrounding me
[01:30.99]一片寂静将我围绕
[01:35.47]I can't seem to think straight
[01:35.47]似乎令我无法理智思考
[01:40.25]I'll sit in the corner 
[01:40.25]我要坐在角落
[01:45.25]And no one can bother me
[01:45.25]不受任何人打扰
[01:47.76]
[01:49.85]I think I should speak now (Why won't you talk to me)
[01:49.85]我想此刻我该诉诸于口 (你为何不再与我谈话)
[01:54.78]I can't seem to speak now (You never talk to me)
[01:54.78]我却不知从何谈起 (你从不与我谈话)
[01:59.36]My words won't come out right (What are you thinking)
[01:59.36]我无法准确表达 (你有何顾虑)
[02:04.21]I feel like I'm drowning (What are you feeling)
[02:04.21]我感觉自己快要被淹没 (你有何感受)
[02:09.12]I'm feeling weak now (Why won't you talk to me)
[02:09.12]此刻我虚弱无力 (你为何不与我谈话)
[02:13.74]But I can't show my weakness (You never talk to me)
[02:13.74]可我不能展露出来 (你从不与我谈话)
[02:18.52]I sometimes wonder (What are you thinking)
[02:18.52]有时我会思考 (你有何顾虑)
[02:23.53]Where do we go from here (What are you feeling)
[02:23.53]我们该往何处去 (你有何感受)
[02:28.17]
[02:38.23]It doesn't have to be like this
[02:38.23]大可不必如此
[02:41.81]All we need to do is make sure we keep talking
[02:41.81]我们只需确保彼此间保持交流
[02:47.41]
[04:04.10](Why won't you talk to me) I feel like I'm drowning
[04:04.10](你为何不与我谈话) 我感觉自己快要被淹没
[04:08.84](You never talk to me) You know I can't breathe now
[04:08.84](你从不与我谈话) 你可知此刻我无法呼吸
[04:13.54](What are you thinking) We're going nowhere
[04:13.54](你有何顾虑) 我们无处可去
